### con tax
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "description": "Una computadora potente",
  "price": 1200.50,
  "tax": 120.00
}


### sin tax
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse",
  "description": "Inalámbrico",
  "price": 25.99,
  "tax": null
}

