### actualiza item
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "Actualizada",
  "price": 1500.00,
  "tax": 150.00
}


### actualiza item con query param q
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/2?q=modo_debug
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor",
  "description": "27 pulgadas",
  "price": 300.00,
  "tax": 30.00
}


